{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nI arrive in Kassel, weary but intact. The diligence from Brunswick was a misadventure; stuck in Northeim until the evening, I hired a post-chaise through Göttingen to Münden, arriving at ten. I slept until six, then continued here. My fellow traveler, a young Englishman of twenty-five returning from Italy to Paris, is loud, ill-dressed, and speaks of “the sublime” with a vulgarity that makes one’s teeth ache. He is a man without a state, purely accidental.\n\nThe food was tolerable, the wine thin. I have paid the driver his due. I think of you and the boys, but mostly I think of the mud on my boots. Tell Karl his father is still alive, if that is of any comfort to him. I shall continue tomorrow.\n\nYours,\nG.W.F."}}],"created":1795218923,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":187,"prompt_tokens":1134,"total_tokens":1321,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-MC33WHycxzBi2uzacYCKQ6wBFxZ8EBV1","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":1134,"prompt_ms":1160.276,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.0231710758377426,"prompt_per_second":977.3536641281902,"predicted_n":187,"predicted_ms":4459.186,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.97411827956989,"predicted_per_second":41.71164871794987}}